  "product": "Jira Service Management",
  "status": "rollout_complete",
  "description": "Jira admins can now use field schemes to manage which fields are available and required for different work types. This new experience replaces the legacy field configurations and field configuration schemes, providing a more intuitive way to ensure projects only include relevant fields. To use field schemes: Go to Jira settings, then Work items.\n\tSelect Field schemes from the sidebar.\n\tChoose an existing scheme to edit or select Create field scheme to start a new one.\n\tUse the Advanced settings ",
